# Curbside Infrastructure Overview

How all the accounts, domains, and services fit together.

---

## The domain

**`curbsidescore.com`** — registered and DNS-managed through **Cloudflare** (nameservers pointed at Cloudflare, all records set to DNS only / grey cloud — proxying is deliberately off everywhere so Vercel and Railway can each issue their own SSL certificates).

| Subdomain | Points to | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `curbsidescore.com` / `www` | Vercel — `curbside-app` project | The whole website |
| `api.curbsidescore.com` | Railway | Backend API |
| `app.curbsidescore.com` | Vercel — `curbside-app` project | 308-redirects to the apex |

**Changed when the two sites merged (2026-08-03).** All three web hostnames now
serve one Vercel project. `app.` stays attached rather than being deleted
because sign-in emails already in inboxes link to `app.curbsidescore.com/saved`,
and the redirect in `curbside-app/next.config.mjs` only fires for requests that
actually reach the app.

