## The extension

- Chrome Web Store listing (currently unlisted).
- `manifest.json`'s `host_permissions` points at `api.curbsidescore.com` (updated from the original Railway-only URL in version 0.1.3).
- **Any change to `host_permissions` requires publishing a new version to the Chrome Web Store** — existing installs don't pick up a backend URL change until the update ships and Chrome auto-updates the install (Chrome checks for updates periodically, not instantly; can be forced via `chrome://extensions` → Developer mode → Update).
- Saves are stored via the Railway backend, tied to a user's account (magic-link auth), and readable at `curbsidescore.com/saved`.

